{"quest_id": 6078, "name": "数多の鬼門", "description": "邪仙妖天君に呼び出された\n数多の鬼門。鬼門より現れる\n妖怪達を滅し、村を救え！\n極級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv25）", "event": "第三次妖怪大戦", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920087, "map_no": 3955, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 65, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 29, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 2, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 5000, "attack": 700, "base_hp": 5000, "base_attack": 700, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 250, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 40, "attack_interval": 201, "move_speed": 100.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.7000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2099376, "change_to": 1, "change_condition": 3, "master_id": 143, "global_id": 142, "to_condition": 3, "to_global_id": 143, "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 5000, "attack": 700, "base_hp": 5000, "base_attack": 700, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 500, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 24, "attack_interval": 49, "move_speed": 1600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.7000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2099392, "special_effect_id": 222, "master_id": 144, "global_id": 143, "from_condition": 3}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 6000, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 250, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 200, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.7000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2099440, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 84, "global_id": 83, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 106}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 2, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 8000, "attack": 900, "base_hp": 8000, "base_attack": 900, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 350, "magic_defense": 15, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 40, "attack_interval": 201, "move_speed": 100.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.850000023841858, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2099408, "change_to": 4, "change_condition": 3, "master_id": 162, "global_id": 161, "to_condition": 3, "to_global_id": 162, "spawn_sec": 112}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "tags": ["アンデッド"], "hp": 8000, "attack": 900, "base_hp": 8000, "base_attack": 900, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 700, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_speed": 24, "attack_interval": 55, "move_speed": 1600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.850000023841858, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2099424, "special_effect_id": 222, "master_id": 163, "global_id": 162, "from_condition": 3}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "落ち武者", "text": "グ……オォ……。", "face": "lf3e47f6bddbb"}]}, {"trigger": "battle", "at_sec": 6, "lines": [{"name": "兵士", "text": "ほ、報告です！　村の至る所に鬼門が出現！\n鬼門より妖怪も現れ始めているとの事です！", "face": "l29763d6fd7f7"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "なんという数の鬼門が……これでは\nコヨミさんを追う事も……！", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "ミコト", "text": "……このままでは村に大変な被害が及びます。\nまずはこの場をなんとかする事が先決です。", "face": "u130"}, {"name": "ミコト", "text": "一時凌ぎではありますが、私は鬼門に\n結界を施します。皆さんは現れた妖怪の対処を。\n……彼女が戻った際、村がなくてはきっと悲しみます。", "face": "u130"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "ミコトさん……はい、その通りですね。\n王子、急ぎ戦闘のご準備をお願いします！", "face": "l6fb66c0f1c78"}, {"name": "カスミ", "text": "あのアンデッドは落ち武者ですね。体力が減る程に\nその攻撃は熾烈さを増します。カスミは村の方々を\n避難させて参りますので、皆さん、どうかお気をつけて。", "face": "u470"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "落ち武者", "text": "グォ……ォ……。", "face": "lf3e47f6bddbb"}, {"name": "兵士", "text": "報告！　辺りに残敵の気配はありません！\n鬼門より現れた妖怪は、全て退治できたと思われます！", "face": "l29763d6fd7f7"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "ご苦労様です。ですが、まんまと\nコヨミさんを連れ去られてしまいましたね。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "ミコト", "text": "コヨミさん……。", "face": "u130"}, {"name": "ヒエン", "text": "心配はご無用にござる。拙者の配下の忍に、\n先程の仙人の後をつけさせております故。\n直に報告がありましょうぞ。", "face": "u112"}, {"name": "ミコト", "text": "本当ですか！", "face": "u130"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "ヒエンさん、助かりました。\nこれでなんとかコヨミさんの足掛かりは\n途絶えずに済みましたね。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "はい。ですが相手は鬼門を操る仙人。\n何の用意もなく向かうのは危険に思えます。", "face": "l6fb66c0f1c78"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "救出するためには、しっかりとした作戦を\n練る必要がありそうです。一度帰還致しましょう。\n王子、お疲れ様です。", "face": "l6fb66c0f1c78"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920087_3955", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 29, "y": 479}, {"k": "m", "x": 432, "y": 427, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 289, "y": 433, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 619, "y": 172, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 211, "y": 473, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 352, "y": 380, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 526, "y": 465, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 629, "y": 502, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 288, "y": 318, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 422, "y": 323, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 492, "y": 269, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 556, "y": 219, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 239, "y": 246, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 699, "y": 198, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 790, "y": 227, "id": 213}, {"k": "m", "x": 573, "y": 111, "id": 214}, {"k": "m", "x": 200, "y": 168, "id": 215}, {"k": "r", "x": 676, "y": 349, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 542, "y": 154, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 626, "y": 217, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 253, "y": 397, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 750, "y": 382, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 373, "y": 295, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 333, "y": 461, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 367, "y": 135, "id": 307}], "events": [{"t": 4.0, "when": "time", "ops": [{"op": "+fx", "name": "obj_00", "fx": "StageGate3", "x": 795, "y": 152}]}, {"t": 6.0, "when": "time", "ops": [{"op": "-fx", "name": "obj_00"}, {"op": "+fx", "name": "obj_01", "fx": "StageGate2", "x": 795, "y": 152}]}, {"t": 25.7, "when": "time", "ops": [{"op": "+fx", "name": "obj_02", "f